        {
          "path": "_m/q/q/x/h/mount-lawu-wk/candi-ceto-lower-terrace-surak.jpg",
          "filename": "Candi Ceto Lower Terrace, Surakarta 1252.jpg",
          "caption": "Candi Ceto is located 900km, a half mile or so, farther up Mt. Lawu from Candi Sukuh. Built a half-century (second half of the 15th century) after C. Sukuh, it is a much kindler and gentler temple, as can be seen from this very human-looking guardian on the lower terrace. Be aware, though, that some of the statues, including the ones seen here, may be more recent than ancient. Never take a restoration for granted!",
          "alt": "Candi Ceto is located 900km, a half mile or so, farther up Mt. Lawu from Candi Sukuh. Built a half-century (second half of the 15th century) after C. Sukuh, it is a much kindler and gentler temple, as can be seen from this very human-looking guardian on the lower terrace. Be aware, though, that some of the statues, including the ones seen here, may be more recent than ancient. Never take a restoration for granted!",
          "width": 2304,
          "height": 3072,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
